ffx-movie contains ports of third-party code
============================================

src/vorbis/ is a Rust port of the libVorbis 1.3.5 decoder and of libogg's
bitwise.c (the code linked into FFX.exe); src/vorbis/tables.rs holds
libVorbis' window and floor 1 tables. libVorbis and libogg are under the
licence below (libogg: Copyright (c) 2002, Xiph.org Foundation, the same
terms).

The VP8 decoder is the vendored zvidlib-vp8 (third_party/zvidlib-vp8, MIT,
with its own LICENSE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).

